        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 73 St Agnes Road, Crumlin, Dublin 12, a superb three-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached family home ideally positioned on this mature and highly sought-after residential road. Presented in turnkey condition throughout, this impressive property offers generous living accommodation together with excellent outdoor space and a number of notable additional features.\nSt Agnes Road is ideally situated within the heart of Crumlin, with a host of local amenities and conveniences all within easy reach. The property is surrounded by a selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational facilities, while both Crumlin Village and nearby Kimmage provide further amenities. There are excellent transport links to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas, with numerous bus routes operating close by. The M50 motorway is also easily accessible, providing convenient access to the wider Dublin region.\nInternally, the property is presented in excellent turnkey condition and offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright and spacious living room and a modern kitchen/dining area with access to the large rear garden. Upstairs there are three well-appointed bedrooms and a family bathroom, providing excellent accommodation for growing families, first-time buyers or those looking to upsize. A particularly attractive feature is the converted garage, which provides valuable additional versatile space and benefits from its own WC and utility space, making it suitable for a variety of uses.\nTo the front, the property benefits from a large low-maintenance garden with off street parking, while the generous rear garden provides excellent outdoor space for entertaining, relaxing or family use. The property also benefits from a BER C rating, adding further appeal from an energy efficiency perspective.\nNo. 73 represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a superb family home in a mature and established Dublin 12 location. With its turnkey presentation, generous gardens, converted garage with WC + utility, spacious accommodation and excellent local amenities, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers. Early viewing is highly advised to appreciate the quality, space and overall appeal this fine home has to offer.\nFeatures\n<ul>\n <li>c. 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom semi-detached home</li>\n <li>c 110 sqm of internal floorspace</li>\n <li>Presented in turnkey condition</li>\n <li>Large front and rear gardens</li>\n <li>Low-maintenance outdoor space</li>\n <li>Side garage converted into additional living space</li>\n <li>BER C rating</li>\n <li>Spacious and well-proportioned accommodation</li>\n <li>Mature and highly sought-after residential location</li>\n <li>Excellent transport links</li>\n <li>Close to a host of local amenities</li>\n <li>Ideal family home</li>\n <li>Viewing highly advised</li>\n</ul>"
      },
      {
